{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_10_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_10","title":"“狼之主”","storyCode":"IS-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"d15a6e852aa677fcd983298c4e9f941ae4f8b95449b83efa44f55009d90690e6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扎羅，狼之主之間不是約定好了，不會干涉凡人的事務嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改變主意了，因為貝納爾多毀了我的計劃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我苦心培養了他六十八年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他，竟敢以自盡來葬送我的勝利！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親......他自盡了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊昂圖索的腦中瞬間閃過父親對狼之主以及這場遊戲的解釋。\n他猛然明白，父親在教堂對自己說的那些話，既是對自己的承認——\n同時也是遺言。\n父親在一開始就做好了自我了結的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"侮辱狼之主的代價是巨大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便他已經死去，我依然要讓他的血脈從此斷絕於這片大地之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多之子，今天，你必須代替你的父親付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份代價，就是他的血脈，你的性命！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"代價？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說代價？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親確實錯了，但他理想的根源，卻始終是改變這個時代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他渴望著一個沒有家族的敘拉古，並為此謀劃了一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為，父親只是將自己的家族作為籌碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為他在此刻發難，只因為時機正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他覺得沒有時間了，錯過這個機會，他就再也無法在實現自己理想的同時，完成對你的復仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在他短暫的一生中，對他傾囊相授，換來的卻是他的背叛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不會明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高高在上，自以為掌控一切的狼之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親甚至將自己的性命，也作為了籌碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使以自己的性命為代價，即使是違抗你這個傲慢的存在，他也要將自己的理想付諸現實！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該為此付出代價的是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無知！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，歡迎回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那邊搞定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該解決這邊的麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忘記，當年是誰許諾你可以離開敘拉古的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你竟敢忤逆我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經完成了與貝納爾多的約定，我不再欠你什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚昧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......貝納爾多，自盡了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i15"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遊戲結束了，拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這就是你那句話真正的含義......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個沒有家族的敘拉古，這就是你真正的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，不告訴我呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小法官，戰鬥的時候怎麼能分心呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這麼有趣的戰鬥，不叫上我也太不夠意思了，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你會來的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，你說得也對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離群的幼狼，閃開，這裡沒有你的立足之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你一個好消息吧，狼之主，或者狼之子，還是什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在起，敘拉古的一切，都將是我的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是你這種超出常人的存在，也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂妄！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領......你也是嗎，如果你站在我的面前，你也會像萊昂這樣，決絕地告訴我，你會選擇你的理想嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......我已經不知道答案了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想死的話，就集中精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞的獠牙，弱小的獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為你窺探了我的獠牙之死，就可以站在我的面前了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應了貝納爾多，我會幫助他的子嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞培養出了一個軟弱的獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我就在這裡，讓她也退出這場遊戲吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你們做什麼，你們都無法毀滅我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們甚至無法傷到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人類，你們建起城市，將自己關入其中，自以為是這片大地的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是學會了擺弄一些工具，別太自以為是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們從未征服荒野。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女士們，先生們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在向你們走來的，是龍門的超級巨星，也就是我，大帝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須提醒你，德克薩斯，你的假期快要結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎麼也來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你問我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你走了之後，空她們也跟著跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"這一個月來你知道我是怎麼過的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺我過去三千年都沒有這麼無聊過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"根本沒人跟我開派對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，扎羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你又要說，我無權在敘拉古干涉你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我一點也不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我仔細想了想，比起和你進行一場毫無意義的廝殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"用你們的規矩打敗你，能更讓我解氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"所以——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i05"},{"type":"narration","text":"一條又一條的暗影自大帝腳下蔓延，並最終凝聚成一個又一個的實體。\n扎羅當然認識他們，他們都是已經在這一輪的遊戲中落敗的狼之主。\n他們出現在這裡，只有一個理由。\n他破壞了規則。\n他們接受他的遊戲方式，但不能允許規則被打破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我特意找來了其他閒得發慌的狼之主們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"向你宣佈一個好消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我親愛的朋友，你失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，敗得很徹底。"},{"type":"narration","text":"狼之主永生不滅，然而，漫長的歲月中，狼之主們早已找到了牽制，壓制，甚至折磨彼此的方法。\n面對諸多與自己相同的存在，扎羅知道，自己的行為已經再無意義。\n他沉默片刻，終於低下了高傲的頭顱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，扎羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你自以為瞭解權力、玩弄權力的樣子，讓我覺得渾身發癢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是現在的你，惱羞成怒，想要把一切違抗你的東西全部撕碎的樣子，更讓我覺得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你確實沒有違背你的本性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你們其他狼也是，這麼一個無聊的遊戲玩了幾千年真的不會膩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應該來龍門跟我學一學怎麼打撲克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，麻將也不錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"扎羅沒有理會大帝的譏諷。\n他只是最後深深看了一眼萊昂圖索，然後，他的身影不斷模糊，模糊，最終，消散在風中。\n像是他從未存在過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"謝我就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，就算我不出手，也會有人出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是把這場好戲讓給了我而已，我說得對吧，美女。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被稱作美女，倒是很久沒有過的經歷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不介意的話，你可以在敘拉古玩上一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我大帝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣的名字，你不像那些狼之主，傲慢又無知，敘拉古歡迎你，大帝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，敘拉古會喜歡我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里夫人——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狼之主之間的遊戲落後而又可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多的兒子，萊昂圖索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以放心，他未來也不會再打擾你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊昂圖索不敢動彈。\n在老人出現的瞬間，他立刻意識到了一件事——結束了。\n不僅僅是狼之主帶來的鬧劇，他們的反抗，也到此為止。\n眼前的老人和藹可親，一股預感卻在他心中油然而生——如果他輕舉妄動，那麼，下一秒，他就會以最悲慘的方式死去。\n但他同樣知道，如果他此時退縮，那此前的一切努力與信念，都將成為泡影。\n他看向拉維妮婭，他從拉維妮婭的眼中看到了同樣的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，西西里夫人，我想過無數種與您面對面的形式，唯獨沒有想過這種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您或許已經瞭解發生了什麼，您或許已經有了決斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但無論如何，我依然希望，您能給我和拉維妮婭一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"機會，什麼樣的機會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對話的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我們的命運最終是死亡，我也想在死前，讓您聽一聽我們的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿格尼爾總是讓我多接觸一下年輕人的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看他是把自己想得太老了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧，孩子們，你們已經為自己贏得了這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以等我一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之前，我想先去看一看貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，德克薩斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒事吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是放心不下你這邊，而且喬萬娜小姐的傷勢也穩定了，我就和可頌趕過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不過，看起來你們這邊好像有種結束的感覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......雖然感覺好像還差點什麼，不過，我們總算可以舉辦派對了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先聊一聊，想要什麼樣的派對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上個廁所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廁所可不在這個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是感覺鬆了一口氣，覺得總算是告一段落了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼前不就還有一樁大麻煩嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。走走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你回到敘拉古之前，其實我收到過一封來自西西里夫人的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜上面寫了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒意思。西西里夫人在上面邀請我成為巨狼之口的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨狼之口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無非是讓我成為她圈養的狼罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我把那封信燒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本以為，又要被敘拉古來的傢伙煩一陣子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果沒想到，你突然返回了敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道當我發現你已經走了的時候，有多驚訝嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你已經決定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會留下來，幫助拉維妮婭和萊昂圖索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，你在自己家族大鬧了一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是去和父親道了個別而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德克薩斯，你是不是其實不知道，我究竟在你身上追求著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有時候以為自己知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但有時候又覺得，我並不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，你看起來，比之前看開了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你還會關心我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，你只是有點煩人而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"原本並肩同行的兩人，像是心有靈犀一般，走到了空曠處的兩端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兜兜轉轉到最後，我們之間，果然還是要有這麼一場啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得嗎，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年前，被烈火包圍的豪宅之前，你走向了我，為了離開這一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天，我輸得體無完膚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而七年後，細雨連綿的公園之中，你再次走向了我，這一次，卻是為了向敘拉古這個國家發起無謀的挑戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，我會殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原話奉還。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i10"},{"type":"narration","text":"兵器碰撞的聲音在公園中不斷響起。\n兩人的招式都毫無花哨可言，招招都旨在直取對方性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用一種詩意的比喻來描述的話，我是你的過去，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為我是如此地相信，沒有人可以逃離這座泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你曾經一度逃離了你的過去，並在重返敘拉古後，決心徹底與過去斷絕關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你向所有人證明了，你有能力和資格擺脫這座泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至為了幫助那頭幼狼改變這座泥潭，而主動留在了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有你說的那麼偉大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的夢想，從一開始就只是，和幾個要好的朋友，過一種簡單的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人要破壞它，那我就會保衛它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼複雜的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來，我都沒有真正認識你，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有發現你對於敘拉古的厭倦，也沒有察覺到你對於哥倫比亞的反感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在想想，我就像我奶奶一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，她這一生都在等待著薩爾瓦多雷爺爺能夠回心轉意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卻從未嘗試過去問一問，去爭取一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是，我總是理所當然地以為，曾經的美好時光將會永遠延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，我是多麼傲慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定不會介意我留在你身邊，我也很想再和空多聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，現在的我，還沒有這個資格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以至少，此時此刻，讓我為《德克薩斯之死》第三幕，關於切利尼娜·德克薩斯的結局，畫上句號吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是如此自由，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人能夠定義你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，讓我換一個說法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你是我的夢魘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你總是出乎我的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你永遠先我一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做出了每一個我無法做出的決斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而直到現在，當我終於像你一樣，邁出了那一步，我才終於能將這些說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼複雜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然我痛恨敘拉古的一切，那我就應當去砸碎它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"結果，最終還是你，讓我走出了這一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你才與你的父親道了別，而且，站在了我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想要和你的過去做個了結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，就和你一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們本不必互相廝殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這一切就是發生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時至今日，我們不約而同地明白，將對方殺死，是對自己的總結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是對對方的饋贈，以及最好的道別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而活下來的那個人，將會變得更強大。"},{"type":"narration","text":"絕不是拉普蘭德變得比德克薩斯強了，又或者說，德克薩斯變弱了。\n正如七年前的那場對決，拉普蘭德也不是因為弱於德克薩斯而慘敗。\n她們的實力，從一開始就旗鼓相當。\n決定她們之間勝負的，除了一些運氣因素，只有——意志。\n七年前，拉普蘭德輸在了意志之上。\n而在與家族訣別之後，她在意志力上也已經不輸於德克薩斯。\n於是，她們之間，誰都有可能贏，也誰都有可能輸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯看了空一眼，旋即緩緩閉上了眼。\n拉普蘭德以為自己已經足夠瞭解德克薩斯了。\n她還有什麼不知道的呢？\n她見證了德克薩斯對敘拉古的厭倦，又目睹了她決定與這個國家開戰的果決。\n每一次，德克薩斯的選擇都出乎了她的意料。\n但這一次，她以為，不會有了。\n你死我活，沒有別的結局。\n然而，這一刻，當她看到德克薩斯眼中的不捨時，她又一次發現，自己錯了。\n在最後的最後，在名為拉普蘭德的存在為自己設計的終局之中，德克薩斯又一次出乎了她的意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，原來如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普蘭德將這場廝殺視作一種訣別，一種解放。\n如果她輸了，那麼，她將接受自己的死亡。\n但是，如果她贏了，她將不再有任何掛念，任何束縛。\n當名為“德克薩斯”的楔子也從她的精神中被拔去的那一瞬間，一個名為“拉普蘭德”的狂人，將真正誕生。\n然而，這一切終究沒有發生。\n因為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，原來，你只是德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然只是德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我也只是拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普蘭德向德克薩斯伸出了手。\n德克薩斯握住了這隻手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，我是你的朋友，還是你的敵人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既是我的朋友，也是我的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我做一點，朋友該做的事吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯向著其他三人點了點頭，然後，與拉普蘭德一同，向著灰廳的方向走去。\n一切是那麼地自然，彷彿事情本該如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到拉維妮婭走進教堂，看到那具靜靜坐在長椅上的屍體時，她才終於相信——\n貝納爾多死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她坐在這個亦嚴父亦長兄，影響了她一生的人身邊，沉默良久。\n她終於還是什麼都沒有說。\n最終，她握住貝納爾多垂下的手，似是向他傳達了什麼，又或是從他那裡獲得了什麼。\n然後，轉身離開。\n斯人已逝，而她只能繼續前進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g9_conferencehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽朋友講述了你的所作所為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，我想問一問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，這片大地上的諸多國家都在順應時代，尋求變革。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，尋求變革的初衷，是意識到自身有所不足，或者是尋求突破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古當真存在這個需求嗎，敘拉古，真的需要改變嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......認為家族是理所應當存在的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有理所應當的存在，只是，它在我出生以前，就已經在這片土地上存在了千百年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們無法否定歷史，更無法輕易地粉碎已經存在的事物，不是嗎，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您在建立灰廳時，選擇了延續家族的體系，只是，所有家族都必須在您的掌控下運轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並沒有否定這一點的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相反，我認為您的選擇在當時很正確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在現在不正確？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞家族的回流，帶回了先進的技術，同時還有先進的思想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族形式的統治，已經逐漸被哥倫比亞人撬動，而許多人尚且還不自知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親的做法，我必須承認，其中有偏激的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的想法出發點和我並不相同，因此，我們的手段也天差地別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，有一點是相同的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都認為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古不再需要家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你又打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最簡單的方法，恐怕是在這裡與您決一生死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這是我父親會做的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想向您借一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有魅力的提案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一座新的城市，確實應當注入一些新的血液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，孩子，你只是孤身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要如何相信，你能夠完成你的目標？"},{"type":"narration","text":"西西里夫人的話音未落，灰廳的大門就被推開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜，最後的德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過來，讓我好好看一看你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和你爺爺長得很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，喬萬娜將我給她的項鍊轉交給了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼願望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想回到龍門，我可以答應你，敘拉古將不會再打擾你的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望，你能放過羅塞蒂家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？這倒是出乎了我的預料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫刺殺了喬萬娜，還幾次三番想要置你於死地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當真願意放過他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也只不過是在以他們的方式生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本就不打算對他們出手，所以，你可以留著這串項鍊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你可以用來交換，永遠離開敘拉古的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯走到萊昂圖索身邊緩緩坐下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒有這個必要了，我打算延長一下我的假期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離群的孤狼，薩盧佐的叛徒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普蘭德嬉笑著走到德克薩斯的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我的想法沒有那麼複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他們都想要毀掉現在的敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的區別是，我的手段沒有那麼文明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭法官，我意志的代理人，你又作何看法？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭徑直走到萊昂圖索的背後站定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意志曾是敘拉古的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但從現在開始，我會去改變它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認為我是錯誤的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是相信，人無法永遠正確。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"西西里夫人看著眼前的四個青年。\n一個人，出身敘拉古最為強大的家族，被周遭環境影響，對文明心生嚮往，卻囿於身份而不得其法，於是選擇了掩耳盜鈴。\n一個人，出身平凡，機緣巧合得到了家族的支持得以生存，卻也因此而陷入了對自己的懷疑，於是選擇了欺騙自己。\n一個人，出身於敘拉古最古老的家族，卻痛恨被強加在身上的，有關這片土地的一切，於是選擇了狀若癲狂的反抗。\n一個人，出身於哥倫比亞最強盛的家族，卻對家族的形式從根本上感到厭倦，於是選擇了無聲的逃離。\n他們想要改變敘拉古的理由各不相同，然而，最終，他們聚集到了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的壽命並非永恆，但我還有幾十年的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我閉上雙眼的那一瞬間之前，敘拉古都將享受我所帶來的安寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你呢，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你站在你父親的肩膀上，追尋著一個更高效，更公平的體制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你認為，你選擇的道路就是正確的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西西里夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我真的將敘拉古交給你，你能保證，敘拉古一定能夠走上更好的道路，成為一個更好的國家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但正如您今天願意坐在這裡聽我的想法一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果到時候，又有新的人想要來顛覆我的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會坐下來，聽一聽他的想法。"},{"type":"narration","text":"西西里夫人笑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我就跟你說嘛，裡面又沒傳來打打殺殺的聲音，他們不會有事的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"也只有你會這麼心大了，那可是這個國家的領導者欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，各位，讓你們擔心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，拉普蘭德......呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯將視線投向某個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已經完成了身為朋友的使命，誰知道她下一次，又會以什麼樣的面貌出現在我們面前呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯一能肯定的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她還會出現在我們面前的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，想想都好麻煩啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦。比起這個，我們先去喬萬娜小姐那裡看一看她的情況吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜小姐，我們回來了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"房間裡空無一人。\n空的喜悅迅速轉變為了困惑。\n但她馬上發現，桌子上整齊地擺放著一疊紙。\n那是一份劇本。\n空翻開第一頁，上面寫著——\n這份劇本送給我親愛的老朋友，切利尼娜。\n以及新朋友，企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"這是《德克薩斯之死》第三幕裡，喬萬娜小姐一直都沒有靈感的情節......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜小姐，這就是你留給我們的東西嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"明明，你不用離開的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]}]}
